_01_12","text":"OK.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_13","text":"So, what do you want to check?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_14","text":"The photo, I, took as evidence, five years ago,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_15","text":"I can't, seem to, find it,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_16","text":"Ah, OK.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_17","text":"First off, you should to go to your phone's gallery.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_18","text":"There should be a slider off to the side. You can use that to scroll through the photos.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_19","text":"Press and hold the slider to scroll up and down quickly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_20","text":"Use the slider to scroll to the approximate time period,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_21","text":"then use your finger to scroll through more slowly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_22","text":"You should be able to find the photo you're looking for.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_23","text":"Um... but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_24","text":"I can't, see the, slider,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_25","text":"It's tiny,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_26","text":"so it's easy to miss. Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_27","text":"Usually, it's translucent, and you can find it at the bottom right of the screen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_28","text":"C'mon, focus and try harder!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_29","text":"Have you found it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_30","text":"Not, yet,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_31","text":"Stop replying and just keep searching for it. Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_32","text":"Found it yet?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_33","text":"Doesn't seem like it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_34","text":"Take a screenshot and let me see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_35","text":"How, do you, take a screenshot?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_36","text":"Well, it depends on what kind of phone you're using.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_37","text":"Which mobile phone are you using?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_38","text":"I, don't know...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_39","text":"Oh my.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_40","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_40","text":"Be patient.","jump":"m_ex_protocol_01_42"},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_41","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_41","text":"Keep at it.","jump":"m_ex_protocol_01_42"},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_42","text":"All right, all right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_43","text":"She really is helpless.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_44","text":"I've got to hold her hand","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_45","text":"every step of the way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_46","text":"All right, to find out the model, go into settings.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_47","text":"General -> Information","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_48","text":"However, some phones don't have a General Settings menu.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_49","text":"If yours doesn't, then just look at the information.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_50","text":"Exga, just, wait, wait for me, just a sec,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_51","text":"Can't, find, settings...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_52","text":"Good grief!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_53","text":"Forget this, how about, I, just go to, a phone, store","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_54","text":"and ask, them how, do it...?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_55","text":"No, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_56","text":"You don't have to go to any phone store.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_57","text":"Just download this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_58","text":"spyware.tpk","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_59","text":"Just tap it and accept.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_60","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_60","text":"Spyware?","jump":"m_ex_protocol_01_62"},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_61","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_61","text":"Hacking software?","jump":"m_ex_protocol_01_62"},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_62","text":"Uh huh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_63","text":"Even if she goes to the shop, she'll only badger me with more questions.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_64","text":"It's easier this way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_65","text":"Not to mention me figuring it out for her is better for my mental health...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_protocol_01_66","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_protocol_01_66","text":"You got this!","jump":null}],"chat":true}